@startuml dtb-technology
!include <archimate/Archimate>
title Technology — Hybrid deployment (DTB)
caption VCB Architecture Modeling Language — Daily Transaction Banking trainee sample
top to bottom direction

' === Nodes ===
Technology_Node(dtbApp, "Node TECH.ND.01\ndtb-app")
Technology_Node(coreLpar, "Node TECH.ND.02\nCore Banking LPAR")

' === System Software ===
Technology_Service(gw, "System Software TECH.SW.01\nAPI Gateway")
Technology_Service(runtime, "System Software TECH.SW.02\nApp runtime")

' === Paths ===
Technology_Artifact(pathWan, "Path TECH.PATH.01\nBank WAN\nsync debit/credit/reverse")
Technology_Artifact(pathNapas, "Path TECH.PATH.02\nOutbound to NAPASSwitch\nwait 30s")

' === Application Components (assigned to nodes) ===
Application_Component(orch, "Application Component\nPaymentOrchestration")
Application_Component(limitSvc, "Application Component\nLimitService")
Application_Component(histSvc, "Application Component\nHistoryService")
Application_Component(coreAd, "Application Component\nCoreAdapter")
Application_Component(napasAd, "Application Component\nNAPASAdapter")
Application_Component(core, "Application Component\nCoreBanking (external)")
Application_Component(napas, "Application Component\nNAPASSwitch (external)")

' === Assignment: Node to System Software ===
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, gw, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, runtime, "assignment")

' === Assignment: Node runs components ===
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, orch, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, limitSvc, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, histSvc, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, coreAd, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(dtbApp, napasAd, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(coreLpar, core, "assignment")

' === Paths connecting nodes ===
Rel_Association(dtbApp, pathWan, "path")
Rel_Association(pathWan, coreLpar, "path")
Rel_Association(dtbApp, pathNapas, "path")

legend bottom
  dtb-app hosts all digital lending components (OA-10 runtime).
  CoreBanking stays on the host LPAR. NAPASSwitch is external partner.
  Internal rail does NOT require the NAPAS path.
  Vendor, storage engine, HA, RTO/RPO are OA-10 — not product facts.
  Only numeric wait that is product fact: NAPAS 30 seconds.
  Teaching diagram — redraw in Archi for the dossier.
endlegend
@enduml
